# Raw Overpass snapshots are generated by `bun db:seed:refresh` and are tens of
# megabytes of machine-written JSON. Marking them generated collapses them in
# GitHub pull requests (they are far past the ~1 MB render limit, so they would
# otherwise suppress the diff and hide the reviewable code), and `-diff` keeps
# `git diff`/`git log -p` from emitting a million lines locally. Review these by
# their effect — the seed's line/station/segment counts — not by their bytes.
packages/api-worker/src/db/seed/snapshots/**/*.json linguist-generated=true -diff
